1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:08,630
An MP4 that seems to wait before it plays.

2
00:00:08,630 --> 00:00:13,990
Read the order of the boxes.

3
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:23,020
One synthetic clip, encoded twice.

4
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:30,240
250 frames both times.

5
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:38,620
Plain: ftyp, free, mdat, moov.

6
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:50,360
The index (moov) is the last box.

7
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:56,950
+faststart: ftyp, moov, free, mdat.

8
00:00:56,950 --> 00:01:06,180
Same size, same frames. The index moved.

9
00:01:06,180 --> 00:01:20,210
No seeking: whole file vs under 50 KB.

10
00:01:20,210 --> 00:01:30,730
Range requests: 3 requests vs 1.

11
00:01:30,730 --> 00:01:42,180
FFmpeg docs: a second pass, can take a while.

12
00:01:42,180 --> 00:01:51,090
Tested with ffprobe. Not tested: a browser.

13
00:01:51,090 --> 00:01:54,920
Check the box order before you upload.

14
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:58,760
Not tested: browsers, other players, fragmented MP4.
